### 1. Available Students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### 2. Available Subjects(availableSeats)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects

### 3. new student adding
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Thilakshi",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "email": "thilakshi@gmail.com",
  "phone": "0771112223"
}

### 4. Kasun→ SPRING201 enrollement
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 1, "subjectId": 2 }

### 5. Nimali → SPRING201  enroll (lastseat)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 2, "subjectId": 2 }

### 6. Ruwan → SPRING201 ❌ Seats full!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 3, "subjectId": 2 }

### 7. Kasun again adding to SPRING201  ❌ Already enrolled!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 1, "subjectId": 2 }

### 8. Kasun' senrollments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/enrollments

### 9. Enrollment cancel කරන්න (available a seat)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments/1/cancel

### 10. now Ruwan can enroll  ✅
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 3, "subjectId": 2 }

### 11. Validation test ❌ (empty name, wrong email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### 12. for not a student ❌ 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/999

### 13. ID is not a number ❌ 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/abc

### 14. breaks JSON (no comma) ❌ 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Test" "lastName": "User" }

### 15. Duplicate email ❌ 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Kasun",
  "lastName": "Copy",
  "email": "kasun@gmail.com"
}

### 16. no URL ❌ 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teachers

### 17. wrong HTTP method ❌ 405
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/subjects

### 18. Students: page 0, for page ,2 records
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?page=0&size=2

### 19. Students: page 1 (remaining)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?page=1&size=2

### 20. Students: firstName  Z→A
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?sort=firstName,desc

### 21. Students: name "ka"  (Kasun, Kumari...)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?name=ka

### 22. Subjects: capacity less-high
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects?sort=capacity,asc

### 23. Subjects: seats available (test 4, 5 after no SPRING201 )
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects?availableOnly=true

### 24. wrong sort field ❌ 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?sort=salary,asc

### 25. if size=1000 get 50 only (check response"size")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?size=1000